# Client env — copy to client/.env. Vite loads .env from ITS OWN root (client/),
# not the repo root. Every VITE_* var here is inlined into the public browser
# bundle, so it must be safe to publish. Server secrets belong in server/.env.

# Standalone API base, e.g. http://localhost:3001 in dev. Empty = same-origin.
VITE_API_BASE=
# Server wallet IDENTITY key (compressed hex) — type-42 counterparty for every
# derived output AND the auth-proof server id. Public. Must equal the server
# wallet's getIdentityKey(); the app refuses to boot without it.
VITE_SERVER_IDENTITY_KEY=
